{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"The chat's session index — list, delete, rename, reorder. Resolves the session's user server-side from nn_sessionid and folds that user's append-only index (runtime/agent/chat/<user>.jsonl) into [{id,title,time}]: newest-first, then the user's saved ordering applied — ids not named in it stay FIRST in newest-first order, so brand-new sessions still appear on top. op=list returns the folded list; op=delete appends a {id,deleted:true} tombstone and returns the folded list; op=rename (id + arg = the new title) stamps custom_title AND title on the session record itself through the gated app.write (ownership-checked — openSession restores it and session_touch rebuilds a lost row with the rename intact), then appends an index row with the new title REUSING the old row's time so a rename never changes the sidebar's order; op=reorder (id ignored; arg = a JSON array of session ids, top to bottom) appends an {order:[ids],time} row — the LATEST order row in the file wins at fold time, and deleted/absent ids are skipped. The session records live in the store and are read/written through the platform's gated paths (app.read / app.write); this command owns only the per-user index file. Admin-gated.","import":"use ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse flowlang::flowlang::system::time::time;\nuse flowlang::command::Command;","params":[{"desc":"list returns the folded [{id,title,time}] newest-first; delete appends a {id,deleted:true} tombstone and returns the folded list; rename stamps a custom title on the session record and appends an index row with it.","name":"op","type":"String"},{"desc":"Session id — required for delete and rename, ignored for list (pass an empty string).","name":"id","type":"String"},{"desc":"rename's new title; pass an empty string for list/delete","name":"arg","type":"String"},{"desc":"Request metadata auto-injected by the framework; resolves the session's user server-side. Pass null from javascript.","name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"JSONObject","type":"rust"},"id":"kjntuo1a0f6c2de8br7e4","readers":[],"time":1793018675312,"username":"system","writers":[]}